// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
//                                          // hypermodern // zellij //
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
//
// Repo-homed (dotfiles/zellij), symlinked to ~/.config/zellij/config.kdl;
// zellij hot-reloads on change — edit and it's live, no reload bind needed.
//
// clear-defaults kills zellij's ambient modal layer (stock binds put
// Ctrl-o/Ctrl-n/Ctrl-p in NORMAL mode — emacs-hostile). What remains is
// exactly the tmux muscle-memory shape: ONE prefix (Ctrl-o), one table.
//
// The theme file (themes/ono-sendai.kdl) is WRITTEN BY WINTERMUTE on every
// reconcile and seeded by nix at activation — do not edit it by hand.

theme "ono-sendai"
default_layout "hypermodern"
pane_frames false
copy_on_select true
session_serialization true
show_startup_tips false
show_release_notes false

keybinds clear-defaults=true {
    normal {
        bind "Ctrl o" { SwitchToMode "tmux"; }
    }

    // The C-o prefix table — tmux muscle memory, verbatim.
    tmux {
        // last-window toggle: C-o C-o
        bind "Ctrl o" { ToggleTab; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }

        // windows → tabs
        bind "n" { GoToNextTab; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
        bind "p" { GoToPreviousTab; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
        bind "c" { NewTab; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }

        // pane cycling
        bind "Ctrl n" { FocusNextPane; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
        bind "Ctrl p" { FocusPreviousPane; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }

        // splits (cwd inherited by default)
        bind "|" { NewPane "Right"; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
        bind "-" { NewPane "Down"; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }

        // the tmux commons
        bind "d" { Detach; }
        bind "x" { CloseFocus; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
        bind "z" { ToggleFocusFullscreen; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
        bind "[" { SwitchToMode "Scroll"; }

        // creature comforts (new verbs, same prefix)
        bind "f" { ToggleFloatingPanes; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
        bind "e" { EditScrollback; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
        // one-shot floating session picker — no sticky mode
        bind "w" { LaunchOrFocusPlugin "session-manager" { floating true; }; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }

        bind "Esc" { SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
    }

    scroll {
        bind "Ctrl p" "Up" "k" { ScrollUp; }
        bind "Ctrl n" "Down" "j" { ScrollDown; }
        bind "Ctrl v" "PageDown" { PageScrollDown; }
        bind "Alt v" "PageUp" { PageScrollUp; }
        bind "Ctrl s" { SwitchToMode "EnterSearch"; SearchInput 0; }
        bind "e" { EditScrollback; SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
        bind "Esc" "q" { SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
    }

    entersearch {
        bind "Enter" { SwitchToMode "Search"; }
        bind "Esc" { SwitchToMode "Scroll"; }
    }

    search {
        bind "n" { Search "down"; }
        bind "p" { Search "up"; }
        bind "Esc" { SwitchToMode "Normal"; }
    }

}
